* EMHD1 -- Helpdesk ticket entry screen
MAP EMHD1 SIZE 24x80
  FIELD HEADER    AT 0,2   LEN 60 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=WHITE
  FIELD CLIENTID  AT 3,20  LEN 8  UNPROT BRIGHT COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD PRIORITY  AT 4,20  LEN 1  UNPROT BRIGHT COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD CATEGORY  AT 4,30  LEN 20 UNPROT BRIGHT COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD SUBJECT   AT 6,5   LEN 60 UNPROT BRIGHT COLOR=WHITE
  FIELD DESCR     AT 8,5   LEN 60 UNPROT DIM    COLOR=WHITE
  FIELD MESSAGE   AT 15,5  LEN 60 PROT DIM    COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD FOOTER    AT 23,2  LEN 60 PROT DIM    COLOR=BLUE
ENDMAP
